{"id":"wb-6-306","name":"健锐营演武厅","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"团城演武厅","text":"团城演武厅，又名健锐营演武厅，位于位于中华人民共和国北京市海淀区香山公园东南1公里处，是清代健锐营的练兵场所，也是北京市现存唯一一处清代武备阅兵建筑群。2006年，健锐营演武厅被列为全国重点文物保护单位。团城演武厅由北京市文物局直属单位北京市团城演武厅管理处管理。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9B%A2%E5%9F%8E%E6%BC%94%E6%AD%A6%E5%8E%85","revisionId":84928325,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84928325","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/fb695991c909f77cc16f6915.jpg","title":"Tuancheng_Yanwuting.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tuancheng_Yanwuting.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/21/Tuancheng_Yanwuting.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"中文維基百科的Endeneon","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"zh:团城演武厅 The Tuancheng Yanwuting, or Tuan Cheng Fortress in Beijing, China","width":320,"height":240}}